# UI verification

When changing web-manager UI, navigation, or role-gated screens:

1. Prefer **Cursor Browser** tools when available — exercise the flow end to end (not screenshot-only).
2. If Browser tools are unavailable, run Playwright against local `pnpm dev` (port 3000):
   - `pnpm --filter @eveider/web-manager test:e2e`
   - Specs live in `apps/web-manager/e2e/`; auth helper uses seed accounts (`EveiderDemo2026!`).
3. For large nav / settings / UX work, add or update a Playwright spec — do not rely only on unit tests.
4. Full guidance: `docs/blueprint/ai/ui-verification.md`.
